WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.420
Gosh, it seems like a thousand years ago

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.160
I fought my way out of that cave

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.440
became Iron Man

00:00:14.785 --> 00:00:16.045
realized I loved you

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:22.485
and when I said "No more surprises", but

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.880
ah, I was really hoping to pull off one last one.

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.860
The world has changed...

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.320
None of us can go back

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.660
All we can do is our best

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.200
And sometimes the best we can do

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:47.900
is to start over

00:01:00.585 --> 00:01:02.265
I saw all these people die

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.180
I keep telling everybody they should move on

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.320
Some do

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.460
but not us

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:20.220
Even if there is a small chance

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.420
we owe this

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.200
to everyone who's not in this room, to try

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.680
We will

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:35.340
whatever it takes

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.140
whatever it takes

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.020
whatever it takes

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.380
whatever it takes

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.100
Hrmph...

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.860
I like this one

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:22.540
Heh Heh

